<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Reduced Course Load Request Form</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif; }
  .form-section { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .field-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .field-label { font-weight: bold; }
  .field-input { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; flex-grow: 1; margin-left: 10px; }
  .divider { border-top: 1px solid #000; margin: 20px 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <img src="logo_placeholder.png" alt="Hope College Logo" style="max-width: 150px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
    <h1 style="margin: 0;">Hope College</h1>
    <h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 14pt;">CENTER FOR GLOBAL ENGAGEMENT</h2>
  </div>
  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">Reduced Course Load Request Form</h2>
  <h3 style="text-align: center;">Hope College – International Students</h3>

  <div class="form-section">
    <h3 style="margin-bottom: 15px;">Part I:</h3>
    <div class="field-row">
      <span class="field-label">Family Name:</span>
      <span class="field-input" data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="field-row">
      <span class="field-label">Cell #:</span>
      <span class="field-input" data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="field-row">
      <span class="field-label">First Name:</span>
      <span class="field-input" data-field="first_name">{{ first_name }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="field-row">
      <span class="field-label">E-mail:</span>
      <span class="field-input" data-field="email">{{ email }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="field-row">
      <span class="field-label">Date of Birth:</span>
      <span class="field-input" data-field="date_of_birth">{{ date_of_birth }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="field-row">
      <span class="field-label">SEVIS #:</span>
      <span class="field-input" data-field="sevis_id">{{ sevis_id }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="field-row">
      <span class="field-label">Hope College ID #:</span>
      <span class="field-input" data-field="college_id">{{ college_id }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <p>Either Part II OR Part III must be completed</p>
    <p>
      <span style="font-weight: bold;">Part II:</span> For academic reasons, have an advisor complete this section
    </p>
    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>I, the academic advisor, certify that the above-mentioned student, majoring in <span data-field="major">{{ major }}</span>, requires a reduction in course load for academic reasons during the following semester:</p>
      <div class="field-row" style="margin-top: 10px;">
        <span class="field-label">Semester/Year:</span>
        <span class="field-input" data-field="semester_year">{{ semester_year }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h4 style="margin-top: 25px;">Reason for supporting approval:</h4>
    <div style="margin-left: 20px;">
      <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
        <span class="field-label">Graduation semester with:</span>
        <span class="field-input" data-field="graduation_semester_reason">{{ graduation_semester_reason }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
        <span class="field-label">Difficulty with English language or reading requirements (1st semester only):</span>
        <span class="field-input" data-field="english_difficulty_reason">{{ english_difficulty_reason }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
        <span class="field-label">Unfamiliarity with U.S. teaching methods (1st semester only):</span>
        <span class="field-input" data-field="teaching_methods_reason">{{ teaching_methods_reason }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="field-row" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
        <span class="field-label">Improper course level placement (Granted once per degree level):</span>
        <span class="field-input" data-field="placement_reason">{{ placement_reason }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
      <div class="field-row">
        <span class="field-label">Name (please print) Title:</span>
        <span class="field-input" data-field="advisor_name">{{ advisor_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="field-row" style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <span class="field-label">Signature Date:</span>
        <span class="field-input" data-field="advisor_signature_date">{{ advisor_signature_date }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <p>
      <span style="font-weight: bold;">Part III:</span> For medical reasons, complete this section
    </p>
    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>Documentation from Dr. <span data-field="doctor_name">{{ doctor_name }}</span> is attached to support my request for approval.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <img src="logo_placeholder.png" alt="Hope College Logo" style="max-width: 150px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
    <h1 style="margin: 0;">Hope College</h1>
    <h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 14pt;">CENTER FOR GLOBAL ENGAGEMENT</h2>
  </div>
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>Hope College – Fried Center for Global Engagement</p>
    <p>257 Columbia Ave. Holland, MI, 49423, USA</p>
    <p>Phone: <span data-field="phone_number_contact">{{ phone_number_contact }}</span> • Fax: <span data-field="fax_number_contact">{{ fax_number_contact }}</span></p>
    <p>E-mail: <span data-field="email_contact">{{ email_contact }}</span></p>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>